  "description": "VMAX R40 Pro – Agile e-scooter for private adventures\nThe VMAX R40 Pro is the ideal electric scooter for everyone who wants to travel quickly and safely on private property. With a powerful 1000 W motor, it gets you up to 40 km/h – perfect for short trips around the house, over driveways, or through expansive grounds. The range of up to 45 km ensures plenty of driving fun.\nThanks to a maximum load capacity of 130 kg, the R40 Pro is versatile and suitable for larger riders. Its sturdy design, precise disc brake system, and 10-inch wheels guarantee control and comfort – even on slopes up to 28 %.\nSafety & Usage Guidelines\nThe VMAX R40 Pro may only be used on private property and is not approved for public road traffic. For your safety, we recommend wearing a helmet as well as additional protective gear. Please always pay attention to safe riding conditions for yourself and your surroundings.\nTechnical Highlights\n\nMax. speed: 40 km/h\nMax. range*: up to 45 km\nMax. load capacity: 130 kg",
